Files in this directory
-----------------------
rowmans.jhf           Roman Simplex — upright Latin letters, digits, operators.
greeks.jhf            Greek Simplex — Greek, lowercase on slots a..x and
                      uppercase on A..X, ordered by POSITION in the Greek
                      alphabet ('a'=alpha, 'b'=beta, 'c'=gamma, ... 'x'=omega),
                      not by transliteration.
HersheyScriptMed.svg  Hershey Script medium, as a single-line SVG font. Prepared
                      2011 and converted to SVG in 2019 by Windell H. Oskay
                      (www.evilmadscientist.com), adapted from
                      emergent.unpythonic.net/software/hershey by way of Marty
                      McGuire's "Hershey Fonts in SVG". Carries the same notice
                      inside its own <metadata> block.

Simplex fonts draw each stroke as ONE line. The Complex and Duplex cuts draw a
stroke as two or more parallel lines to fake a heavier weight — which reads as
a doubled pen trajectory once the player writes the glyph out, so the simplex
cuts are the ones this project wants.

rowmans.jhf and greeks.jhf come from https://github.com/kamalmostafa/hershey-fonts
(the .jhf font data there is under this Hershey licence; the code in that
repository is GPL-2 and is not used here).
